      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. **Office Established.** As a pilot project to test the efficiency of a centralized office to address the problem of unlawful sexual harassment, there is hereby established an Office for Sexual Harassment Prevention (\"Office\"). The Office shall be headed by the Director of the Office for Sexual Harassment, who shall be appointed by the Mayor. For Administrative purposes, the Office shall be located in the Department of Personnel.",
